WEBVTT

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.050
Wow!

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.700
I'll always be your friend.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:21.660
Don't cry when you fall, okay?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.330
Yuzuyu-chan seems down.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:47.390
Ever since that boy, Shou-chan, left...

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:51.430
It's a case of lost love. Lo-st lo-ve.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.180
She's been digging that hole for a long time.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.850
Hey, you go talk to her!

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:02.740
Yuzuyu-chan...

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:11.800
It's almost time for summer vacation,
but let's play together then too, okay?

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:30.870
Everyone, it's almost time for summer vacation!

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:34.690
So, are you all going somewhere with your families?

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.090
I am. I'm going to the beach!

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.630
I'm going to my grandpa's!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:46.320
All right! Once summer vacation is over, we will start pool sessions.

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:51.130
It might be a good idea for you to practice swimming during the summer.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.690
Huh? Pool?

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:57.790
Yeah, the pool! What bathing suit should I wear this year?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.550
Yuzuyu, what is yours like?

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.820
No, not the pool...

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:04.990
Huh?

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:06.970
N-No!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.460
Hey, what's wrong, Yuzuyu?

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:14.860
Sensei!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:17.130
Yuzuyu-chan...

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:24.850
Your long-awaited summer vacation starts tomorrow.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:26.640
When it's time to play, you play.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.350
When you're supposed to learn, you learn.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:31.970
Please don't forget that you are students, and have a good time.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:38.260
Finally, the first semester is over.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.530
Hey, your yawns are contagious.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.890
Sorry, I'm not good with these types of lectures.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.700
You're good at sleeping through them.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:56.130
Hey, do you want tickets to Hot Blue?

00:04:57.510 --> 00:05:00.880
I'm working part-time all summer, so I can't use them.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:03.900
I don't want them. I don't have anyone to go with.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.260
Yeah, okay.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.720
Give them... to me!

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.320
Hey, it's Katakura.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.450
Long time no see, Kippei!

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.130
Give me those tickets!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.630
Okay, how much should I sell them to you for?

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.060
You're going to charge me?

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.000
Okay, then thirty yen!

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.690
Thirty yet?! Are you kidding me?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.900
What's Kippei doing?

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:27.780
I don't know.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.040
Bye, Kippei!

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:34.070
I was able to buy them for thirty yen...

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.410
Hey, Kippei!

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.930
Who are you going to the pool with?

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.640
With Yuzuyu-chan...

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:49.380
Is Yuzuyu doing well?

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:54.720
Actually, she came home crying yesterday.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:03.210
I don't wanna go to the pool!

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:08.800
So, Yuzuyu-chan is scared of the pool.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:13.190
Well, kids don't usually like the water at first.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:17.640
But as her guardian,
I have to do something about this!

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:20.060
She can't be different from all her peers!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.290
What's with you, Kippei?

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.460
So anyway, I'm heading out for the day!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.030
See you. Bye-bye!

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.030
Huh? You're going home?

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:35.870
We're not going to see each other for a little over a month!

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:38.680
"Don't just pay attention to the kid."

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:41.470
"Pay attention to me too!"

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.080
What are you doing?

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.490
Acting out your feelings...

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.650
That's <i>not</i>  how I feel.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:51.580
Kokoro, you have to express your feelings more.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.910
You're up against Kippei The Dense here.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.850
Anyway, standing here talking is making me hot.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:04.660
I want to go to the pool, too!
And with Kokoro!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:05.400
What?

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:08.170
Yeah, Hot Blue is nearby.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:12.170
I don't want to go. And anyway, it's not nearby.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:16.830
Kokoro, let's go! Kokoro!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:40.620
Wow! The pool seems fun, doesn't it?

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.470
What's wrong?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.710
You don't like the hand-me-down bathing suit from Nee-chan?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:59.570
I didn't know Nee-chan was
the type to keep mementos.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.380
Take good care of it!

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:09.730
She said to be careful, but I wonder if she's still planning to keep it.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:13.130
Okay, let's go, Yuzuyu!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.340
This is difficult.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:26.740
You don't have to swim, you just have to put your head under.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.110
Okay, ready?

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:37.860
Yuzuyu-chan, are you awake?

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:41.640
I'm scared.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.540
It'll be okay.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.140
Just think of it as a big bathtub.

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.610
You're fine in the bathtub.

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:52.040
Uh-oh...

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.790
Yuzuyu... No... Wait a second.

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:21.530
I'm sorry.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:25.140
Were you wondering what I was doing?

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:27.530
I hate you.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.600
Oh, man.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.260
What should I do?

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.100
Kippei Onii-chan~!

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:56.470
What are you doing?

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:59.500
Hey, act a little more surprised!

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.510
What are you doing, Kokoro-chan?

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:46.440
Because...

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:52.440
Hey, you two! Stop fooling around.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:56.420
What's your angle in making her come here like this?

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.910
Kokoro-chan, please put your clothes on.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.660
What a waste...

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:10.780
What do you mean, "What a waste"?

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:17.020
I thought you would want to see Kokoro in a swimsuit, so I brought her here.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:19.160
Stop it.

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:21.290
Seriously?

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:30.330
Have sex with me.

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:31.640
Die!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:36.840
Hey...

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.780
We'll go over there.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:50.390
What? You're not going to stay with him?

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.160
Kokoro, wait for me!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:02.230
Kippei Onii-chan, aren't you going to play with them?

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:12.900
I'm not going to play with other people,
because I have you.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:21.400
Okay, let's try to go underwater!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:31.270
I'll hold your hand, so you can put your face in the water.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:36.330
No! Let me go! No!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:36.940
No!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.400
It's okay.
No!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:43.350
No! No! Stupid! No! Stupid!

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:46.770
Stupid! No!
I'm starting to get irritated, And, she called me stupid.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:47.380
I'm starting to get irritated, And, she called me stupid.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.760
What are you so scared of, anyway?

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:05.580
I've fallen into a pool before.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:06.780
Huh?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:09.490
It hurts when...

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.240
...you get water in your nose.

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:16.410
Huh, so you did have a good reason.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:21.410
Let's take a little break then, okay?

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:30.700
Want something to eat?

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:31.750
Hot dog!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.440
Okay, wait here then.

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.340
We'll try again after we take a break.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:47.330
Hey, let's go on that, Kokoro!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:52.040
No thanks. I'm not the type.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.660
What's that? We're going to go without you!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.380
Yeah, go ahead.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:58.990
See you later!

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.140
Hey,

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.010
you're all alone.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:15.550
Aren't you lonely?

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:16.900
Want to play with us?

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.840
Why are you putting that on?

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:24.500
Don't touch me! I have a boyfriend.

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.560
So where is he?

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.890
What are you doing?

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.620
Huh? Who's this girl?

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:40.020
Yuzuyu.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.190
Yuzuyu, come here.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.970
This is my child.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.430
Oh, forget it the n.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.360
Bye-bye.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:00.980
Weird girl...

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:06.740
Kokoro Onee-chan, I'm not your child.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.780
Yeah, I'm sorry. I guess that was a bit too much.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:18.020
What's wrong, Yuzuyu-chan?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:23.260
You can go play with Kippei Onii-chan.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.560
I'll wait right here.

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:38.720
Yuzuyu-chan, do you hate me?

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.850
I don't hate you!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:45.120
But I can't say it right, so...

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:49.760
Go play!

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.230
Forget about Kippei.

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:02.610
Yuzuyu-chan, will you play with me?

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:08.290
Yeah!

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:18.550
Hey, Yuzuyu! Why are you running away!

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.660
There he is! Devil!

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:24.120
Why are you two together?

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:25.930
What're you doing?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.410
It's okay if she can't go underwater.

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:31.300
She'll be able to one day.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:35.970
Hey, Kokoro! That day is today!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:38.810
Devil!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:01.190
No, I really don't want to.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.300
Don't cry, don't cry.

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:12.040
As long as you don't breathe in through your nose,
you won't get any water in it.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:19.550
If you can do it, your mom will probably be very happy.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:23.720
Mommy?

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:24.750
Yeah.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:02.480
Honey, Yuzuyu fell in!

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:09.040
Mommy, Mommy!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:15.370
Yuzuyu, you don't have to cry so much. You're okay.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:16.750
You're okay.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:21.280
Mommy's right here.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:31.620
Yuzuyu!

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:35.690
I did it! I went underwater!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.970
You did it! You did it! Amazing!

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:41.860
You're a genius! A super genius!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:43.730
Yay!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.190
That's a bit of an exaggeration...

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:50.020
Amazing! Amazing! Amazing! Amazing!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:53.840
Amazing! Amazing!
You're really a genius, Yuzu!

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:56.100
Good job!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:03.150
Yuzuyu, see you again!

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.080
Yup!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:07.730
Kippei, don't have any affairs this summer.

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:09.110
What?

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.780
I'll call you.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.130
Bye-bye!

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:35.850
Good for you, Kokoro.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.580
Yuzuyu's cute.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:50.880
After you go to the pool,
having popsicles is the best.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:54.490
I'm so happy I was able to go underwater.

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:05.370
Popsicle! It's so good! I like it!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:12.790
I wonder how long we'll be able to be like this.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:16.140
Huh? What's that?

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:21.030
I said I love you, Yuzuyu.

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:26.160
Me too! I love you, Kippei Onii-chan!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:27.610
Yup, yup.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.400
This popsicle is really good.

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:34.040
Yeah, popsicles are good!

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:38.290
I like popsicles.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.820
I'm sleepy.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:51.150
We're almost there.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:53.040
Sleepy...

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.660
Bang!

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:58.890
Huh?

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:05.080
Who are you?

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.850
It's Miki-chan!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.500
Do you know her, Yuzuyu?

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:19.110
Yuzuyu, it's been so long!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.380
You seem to be doing well.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.110
Hey, what's with you girls?

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:32.300
Who <i>are</i>  you?

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:36.640
Be quiet. I'm Sakashita Miki, Yuzuyu's cousin.

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:42.310
I came to pick you up.

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:38.390
Yuzuyu, it's a letter for you.

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:47.900
I wonder who it's from.

00:23:51.100 --> 00:23:53.020
Hey, it's you.

00:24:00.480 --> 00:24:01.380
Shou-chan...

00:24:19.640 --> 00:24:21.040
Wh-What?

00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:22.260
Water gun!

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:24.140
Your hair is very red.

00:24:24.330 --> 00:24:27.350
She's my cousin, Miki. She's fourteen!

00:24:27.440 --> 00:24:28.610
A middle-schooler?

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:31.380
She said she came to pick me up.

00:24:32.770 --> 00:24:34.200
Wh-What?

00:24:34.520 --> 00:24:36.140
I'm not going to hand you over!

00:24:37.270 --> 00:24:39.160
Next episode of Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:39.620 --> 00:24:41.630
Miki-chan, The Redhead.

00:24:42.500 --> 00:24:45.770
I don't want to leave Kippei Onii-chan!
